    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What kind of game is Pixel Gun Master?</strong></h2>Pixel Gunmaster is a roguelike shooter action game about a protagonist who is turned into a demon and goes on a journey to undo his wish.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft your own firearms!</strong></h2>Create your own firearms by combining 9 different gun parts, including barrels, stocks, magazines, and buttplates.<br>Each gun part changes your gun's effectiveness and appearance in real-time!<br>From sniper shotguns to taser guns with bananas!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/0c042950a732640938b13cea3257f90f.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the onslaught of enemies</strong></h2>Enemies are pouring in from all directions! Survive until the stage time runs out!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/24e29a967d06694e061eab978f6be8c6.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Stage Selection</strong></h2>Preview the next stage's rewards and choose your path.<br>Low risk low return? High risk high return? The strategic choice is yours!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/1b68853850299967552187149eba34ab.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Variety of Warrior Characters</strong></h2>Welsh Kogi isn't the only hero to take on dungeons!<br>With the update, you'll also be able to meet a variety of other Heroic characters.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/79724322ca34914dbc26fbdfcaaed6d2.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Watch out for powerful bosses</strong></h2>The final stages of the region contain powerful bosses.<br>Find out the pattern and attack to defeat the boss and advance to deeper areas!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/0c0a112714455b1311f8039d54c4115f.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't give up when you die!</strong></h2>The gold you earn in the game is converted into experience and used to level up.<br>Level up and challenge deeper mawgul with a more powerful protagonist!<br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">*Pixel Gun Master is an Early Access game*</h2></strong><br>Stay tuned for more content to come.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What kind of game is Pixel Gun Master?</strong></h2>Pixel Gunmaster is a roguelike shooter action game about a protagonist who is turned into a demon and goes on a journey to undo his wish.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft your own firearms!</strong></h2>Create your own firearms by combining 9 different gun parts, including barrels, stocks, magazines, and buttplates.<br>Each gun part changes your gun's effectiveness and appearance in real-time!<br>From sniper shotguns to taser guns with bananas!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/0c042950a732640938b13cea3257f90f.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the onslaught of enemies</strong></h2>Enemies are pouring in from all directions! Survive until the stage time runs out!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/24e29a967d06694e061eab978f6be8c6.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Stage Selection</strong></h2>Preview the next stage's rewards and choose your path.<br>Low risk low return? High risk high return? The strategic choice is yours!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/1b68853850299967552187149eba34ab.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Variety of Warrior Characters</strong></h2>Welsh Kogi isn't the only hero to take on dungeons!<br>With the update, you'll also be able to meet a variety of other Heroic characters.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/79724322ca34914dbc26fbdfcaaed6d2.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Watch out for powerful bosses</strong></h2>The final stages of the region contain powerful bosses.<br>Find out the pattern and attack to defeat the boss and advance to deeper areas!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153720/extras/0c0a112714455b1311f8039d54c4115f.avif?t=1701235480\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't give up when you die!</strong></h2>The gold you earn in the game is converted into experience and used to level up.<br>Level up and challenge deeper mawgul with a more powerful protagonist!<br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">*Pixel Gun Master is an Early Access game*</h2></strong><br>Stay tuned for more content to come.",
